WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
Who does the House of Flowers belong to?

2
00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:12.740
The House of Flowers was built on private land that before the Second World War belonged to the famous engineer and mayor of Belgrade Miloš Savčić.

3
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.940
The state confiscated his family's property in 1946.
